{"strongs": "H3909", "word": "לָּט", "translit": "lat", "root": "לט", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "secrecy, mystery", "definition": "לָּט , לָאט noun [masculine] secrecy, mystery ; — absolute לָט 1Sam 18:22 + 2 t., לָאט Judg 4:21 plural suffix לָטֵיהֶם Exod 7:22 + 2 t.; לַהֲטֵיהֶם Exod 7:11 — always with ׃בְּ \\ \\ l. בַּלָּט = secretly 1Sam 18:22 ; 1Sam 24:5 ; Ruth 3:7 so בַּלָּאט Judg 4:21 . 2. בְּלָטֵיהֶם with their mysteries = enchantments (i. e. of חַרְטֻמֵּי מִצְרַיִם ) Exod 7:22 ; Exod 8:3 ; Exod 8:14 = בְּלַהֲטֵיהֶם Exod 7:11 (all P ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4365')\">BDB4365</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3814')\">H3814</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3909')\">H3909</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3858')\">H3858</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4364')\">BDB4364</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4366')\">BDB4366</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>לָּט</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>לָאט</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>secrecy, mystery</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>לָט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:22\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,22)\">1Sam 18:22</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>לָאט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 4:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,21)\">Judg 4:21</ref> plural suffix <bdbheb>לָטֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,22)\">Exod 7:22</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>לַהֲטֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,11)\">Exod 7:11</ref> — always with <bdbheb>׃בְּ</bdbheb> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>l.</b> <bdbheb>בַּלָּט</bdbheb> = <highlight>secretly</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:22\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,22)\">1Sam 18:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 24:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,24,5)\">1Sam 24:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ruth 3:7\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(8,3,7)\">Ruth 3:7</ref> so <bdbheb>בַּלָּאט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 4:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,21)\">Judg 4:21</ref>. <div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>בְּלָטֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <highlight>with their mysteries</highlight> = enchantments (i. e. of <bdbheb>חַרְטֻמֵּי מִצְרַיִם</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Exod 7:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,22)\">Exod 7:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 8:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,3)\">Exod 8:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 8:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,14)\">Exod 8:14</ref> = <bdbheb>בְּלַהֲטֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,11)\">Exod 7:11</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Sam 18:22", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 18, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Judg 4:21", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Exod 7:22", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Exod 7:11", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "1Sam 24:5", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 24, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ruth 3:7", "book": "RUT", "chapter": 3, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Exod 8:3", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Exod 8:14", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 14}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["לָּט", "לָאט", "לָט", "לָטֵיהֶם", "לַהֲטֵיהֶם", "׃בְּ", "בַּלָּט", "בַּלָּאט", "בְּלָטֵיהֶם", "חַרְטֻמֵּי מִצְרַיִם", "בְּלַהֲטֵיהֶם"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["P"]}, "covers": ["H3814", "H3909", "H3858"], "bdbid": "BDB4365", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}